{title: Tuyo Soy (I Am Yours)}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
1. Mi Cristo, mi Cristo,
La Luz de mi alma,
La Esperanza de mi vida,
Y el Señor de todos.
Mi Cristo, mi Cristo,
Me has salvado, me has salvado,
Y Te digo, por siempre,
Tuyo soy.

Verse 2
My Jesus, my Jesus,
The Light of my soul,
The Hope of my life,
And the Lord of all.
My Jesus, my Jesus,
You have saved me, You have saved me,
And I tell You that forever,
I am Yours.

Verse 3
2. Jesús, mi Dios,
Tú has hecho el mundo,
Y has hecho mi alma
Para vivir en Tu amor.
Jesús, Tú murió,
Para que yo puedo vivir,
Y Te digo, por siempre,
Tuyo soy.

Verse 4
My Jesus, my God,
You have made all the world,
And You have made my very soul
To abide in Your love.
My Jesus, You died
So that I now may live,
And I tell You that forever
I am Yours.

Verse 5
(Repeat 1, add flute)

Verse 6
Mi Cristo, mi Cristo,
La Luz de mi alma,
La Esperanza de mi vida,
Y el Señor de todos.
Mi Cristo, mi Cristo,
Me has salvado, me has salvado,
Y Te digo, por siempre,
Tuyo soy...
Y Te digo, por siempre,
Tuyo soy.
